; config-override.g
; This file is regenerated automatically by M500 (see set_tool_lenght.g and
; calibrate_touch_probe.g). It is loaded at boot by the M501 command at the end of config.g.
; Do NOT edit by hand - your changes will be overwritten the next time M500 runs.
;
; Until the first M500 is executed these are the defaults from config.g:
G10 P1 Z0                ; Tool 1 Z offset (set by set_tool_lenght.g)
G31 K0 P500 X0 Y0 Z0     ; Tool length setter trigger height
G31 K1 P500 X0 Y0 Z0     ; Z touch probe trigger height (set by calibrate_touch_probe.g)
